      "name": "J3/J4 BUS LINK",
      "pins": [
        "J3",
        "J4"
      ],
      "note": "J4 joins the K1-K4 output leg feeding P1-3 to the K5-K8 leg feeding P1-6, J3 joins the C leg to the F leg. Fitted: one 8x1 switcher, output on 6/F (and 3/C in parallel). Removed: two 4x1 switchers, IN 1-4 to 3/C, IN 5-8 to 6/F. Reading of which bus is which is from the wiring, not stated in words."
    }
