  "unread": [
    "no title block, drawing number or date on the picture",
    "connector name not drawn; 'P1' assumed",
    "the relay coil supply: CTL n lands on the coil through CRn (1N4003); coil other end to +24V CTL on pin 1 - control is a ground/switch closure to CTL n, read from wiring"
  ],
  "confidence": "high",
  "notes": "Schematic only: 8 relays K1-K8 (CR odd = series diode, CR even = coil clamp, 1N4003), each switching a balanced input pair onto the output bus. Inputs: IN1 15/S, IN2 14/R, IN3 13/P, IN4 12/N, IN5 11/M, IN6 10/L, IN7 9/K, IN8 8/J. Controls CTL1-8: 2, B, 4, D, 5, E, 7, H. No +/- marks: a = number pin, b = letter pin. Output ports named OUTPUT A (6/F) and OUTPUT B (3/C) here; the drawing labels both just OUTPUT."
